cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the replay-record-not-decision released data and verification tooling, please cite this deposit."
type: dataset
title: "Replay reproduces the record, not the decision — released data and verification tooling"
abstract: >-
  Released data and verification tooling for the replay-record-not-decision
  (paper #2) note. This deposit is NOT the paper text and NOT the measurement
  harness: it ships the two frozen record files the published numbers rest on
  (decision-variants.jsonl, 3,040 rows = 4 models x 190 cases x 4 variants;
  l1-head-to-head.jsonl, 380 rows = 2 models x 190 cases) and the script that
  re-derives every published number from those stored records. It ships no
  harness, no model weights and no stimulus fixture: the 190-case stimulus
  releases with the companion note (Zenodo concept DOI
  10.5281/zenodo.23463944) and is referenced here, not copied. The checks do
  not retrain an arm, re-render a model input, or re-run the evaluation
  pipeline.
authors:
  - family-names: "Kalugasala Moorthy"
    given-names: "Aswin Ram"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
license-url: "https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0"
keywords:
  - "replay-record-not-decision"
  - "replay divergence"
  - "recorded decision traces"
  - "released data"
  - "verification tooling"
date-released: "2026-10-19"
# Year of the deposit: 2026. date-released above is the package build date recorded in
# MANIFEST.json ("generated_utc": "2026-10-19T06:15:00Z"); the author should set the
# actual deposit date here on upload if it differs.
#
# DOI: assigned by Zenodo on publication, 2026-10-19.
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23482511"
