#   "DOI: deliberately absent. No DOI exists for this deposit yet. Zenodo assigns one on
#    publication; add it here afterwards as  doi: \"10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX\"."
# That is no longer true. The concept DOI named in the abstract (10.5281/zenodo.23463944) is the
# COMPANION NOTE's deposit (paper #3, the companion release), which carries the stimulus fixture;
# it is NOT this deposit's DOI and must not be copied into the doi field above.
